Install Netopeer2
    [Arguments]    ${target_ip}    ${username}=ute    ${password}=${NONE}    ${ssh_key}=/home/ute/.ssh/id_rsa
    ...            ${expected_prompt}=$
    ${login_with_pass}            Evaluate    $password is not None
    SSHLibrary.Open Connection    host=${target_ip}
    Run Keyword If                ${login_with_pass}
    ...                           SSHLibrary.Login                    username=${username}    password=${password}
    ...    ELSE                   SSHLibrary.Login With Public Key    username=${username}    keyfile=${ssh_key}
    SSHLibrary.Set Client Configuration    prompt=${expected_prompt}
    SSHLibrary.Write                       sudo apt install -y netopeer2
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds            6x    10s    Check Netopeer2 Installation
    SSHLibrary.Write                       sudo apt list --installed | grep netopeer2
    Sleep                                  3s    reason=Wait for command processing...
    ${grep_output}=                        SSHLibrary.Read
    ${netopeer2_installed}                 Evaluate    "netopeer2" in $grep_output
    Run Keyword If                ${netopeer2_installed}
    ...                           Log     Netopeer2 was successfully installed    console=${TRUE}
    ...    ELSE                   Fail    msg=Installation failed!

Check Netopeer2 Installation
    SSHLibrary.Write    \
    ${output}=          SSHLibrary.Read
    Should End With     ${output.strip()}    $
